:PREFIX EXECUTE p_eq('2020-03-08 00:00:00');
--- QUERY PLAN ---
 Aggregate (actual rows=1.00 loops=1)
   ->  Custom Scan (ChunkAppend) on date_ca (actual rows=1.00 loops=1)
         Chunks excluded during startup: 9
         ->  Seq Scan on _hyper_1_5_chunk (actual rows=1.00 loops=1)
               Filter: (day = $1)

EXECUTE p_eq('2020-03-08 00:00:00');
