----------+---------------------+----------+----------+-----+---------------------+-------------+----
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 00:00:00 | day > T  |        4 |   5 |                   5 |           5 | t
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 00:00:00 | day >= T |        4 |   6 |                   6 |           6 | t
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 00:00:00 | day < T  |        6 |   4 |                   4 |           4 | t
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 00:00:00 | day <= T |        5 |   5 |                   5 |           5 | t
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 00:00:00 | day = T  |        9 |   1 |                   1 |           1 | t
 UTC      | 03-08-2020 12:00:00 | day > T  |        4 |   5 |                   5 |           5 | t
